[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11108.03, "timestamp": "03:05:08", "text": "曾经。史上最佳游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11112.63, "timestamp": "03:05:12", "text": "D，我要去哪里？ D."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11115.95, "timestamp": "03:05:15", "text": "这长椅真是太酷了。我将使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11122.95, "timestamp": "03:05:22", "text": "它。所以，请稍等。我在哪里？我应该在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11125.71, "timestamp": "03:05:25", "text": "走吗？难道我不应该解决这个问题吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11129.23, "timestamp": "03:05:29", "text": "信标？谁在开枪？哦，你是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11131.349, "timestamp": "03:05:31", "text": "等等，我来了。等等，等等，等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11149.67, "timestamp": "03:05:49", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11156.07, "timestamp": "03:05:56", "text": "BR。好了，我想我已经彻底搞定了。"}]